OL,4,BLincoln sack head coach duo Cohen and  
OL,5,BShaw after only six months             
OL,6,GLincoln City have sacked their head    
OL,7,Gcoaches Chris Cohen and Tom Shaw just  
OL,8,Gsix months after they took joint       
OL,9,Gcharge of the Championship side.       
OL,11,FThe pair departed a little over 12     
OL,12,Fhours after they oversaw a 4-0 defeat  
OL,13,Fat fellow strugglers Charlton Athletic 
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.                            
OL,16,FThe loss leaves the Imps just three    
OL,17,Fpoints above the relegation places in  
OL,18,Fwhat is the club's first season back   
OL,19,Fin the second tier for 65 years.       
